Interpretation of the exact growth loop at 0x19d144820..0x19d144838:
while the current size is below the required size, it doubles sizes below
0x200000 and adds 0x100000 at or above 0x200000. Therefore 0x10000 was not
an IOGPU command-buffer protocol limit.
